
@startuml seq_checkin_checkout
title Increment 7 - Check-in / Check-out Sequence Diagram

autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Receptionist
participant "Staff UI" as UI
participant "FastAPI Backend" as API
participant "Reservation Service" as RS
participant "Identity Verification Service" as IV
participant "Room Service" as RMS
participant "Stay Service" as SS
database "Application Database" as DB

== Find Reservation ==

Receptionist -> UI: Search booking reference
UI -> API: GET reservation by reference
API -> RS: Find confirmed reservation
RS -> DB: Retrieve reservation and guest
DB --> RS: Reservation details
RS --> API: Reservation details
API --> UI: Display reservation
UI --> Receptionist: Show guest and booking details

== Check-in ==

Receptionist -> UI: Confirm guest identity
UI -> API: Submit manual verification result
API -> IV: Record receptionist confirmation
IV -> DB: Save verification record
DB --> IV: Verification saved
IV --> API: Verification confirmed

Receptionist -> UI: Request room assignment
UI -> API: Submit reservation and room selection
API -> RS: Validate reservation status
RS -> DB: Check confirmed reservation
DB --> RS: Reservation status

alt Reservation is not confirmed
    RS --> API: Reject check-in
    API --> UI: Return validation error
else Reservation is confirmed
    API -> RMS: Validate selected physical room
    RMS -> DB: Check room type, availability and readiness
    DB --> RMS: Room details and operational status

    alt Room is unsuitable or unavailable
        RMS --> API: Reject room assignment
        API --> UI: Display reason
    else Room is suitable
        RMS --> API: Room assignment allowed
        API -> SS: Create active stay
        SS -> DB: Save stay and assign room
        DB --> SS: Stay created
        SS --> API: Check-in successful
        API --> UI: Display check-in confirmation
        UI --> Receptionist: Show active stay
    end
end

== Check-out ==

Receptionist -> UI: Select active stay and request checkout
UI -> API: Submit checkout request
API -> SS: Validate active stay
SS -> DB: Retrieve stay and assigned room
DB --> SS: Stay and room details

alt Stay is not active
    SS --> API: Reject checkout
    API --> UI: Display validation error
else Stay is active
    SS -> DB: Record checkout time and end stay
    SS -> API: Request folio finalization
    API -> DB: Close folio, add early/late checkout charge if applicable
    DB --> API: Folio closed, balance due
    SS -> RMS: Request room status update
    RMS -> DB: Update room readiness status
    DB --> RMS: Room updated
    RMS --> SS: Room status update confirmed
    SS --> API: Checkout successful
    API --> UI: Display checkout confirmation
    UI --> Receptionist: Show completed checkout
end

@enduml
